      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Before I read the post details I thought you were requesting the ability to set world instances to a real world height mode. I think that would be a hilarious feature that I hope some udon creators apply. To walk around publics and see all users as their correct height sounds like a fun world toggle. \n\nTake my upvote anyway as this sounds useful. Maybe one day we could proportion our avatar bone lengths in game and this real world button would be far more useful as well.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
