      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This would be good for specific gamemodes where bigger avatars have a clear advantage and where movements and actions that are 1to1 with reality are wanted. Although it doesn't have to be tracked by FBT. So long as the scale of the camera is 1.00 a real meter will be a game meter. But then the issue is the avatar proportions. With off proportions your real feet will be below or above the ground. I think it would be sorta pointless to have a button to set real height only for you to be bigger or smaller because of off proportions.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
