      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Beyond this, there should also be automatic armspan adjustment. Though, I'm not sure even this is enough metrics for FBT when using avatars that are differently proportioned than your own body. But everyone has controllers, and they are held in roughly similar positions, so maybe armspan at least is a doable measurement.",
